<a class="country-hub-card" href="/food-crisis-by-country/nigeria/"><img class="country-hub-thumb" src="/images/articles/nigeria-food-insecurity.jpg" alt="Smallholder farming landscape in northeastern Nigeria with cultivated fields and harvested crops." loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="country-card-tag">Early warning · Jun–Nov 2026</span><h2>Nigeria</h2><p>FAO–WFP's heightened concern in northeast Nigeria and the specific risk described for some populations in Borno State.</p><span class="country-card-link">Read Nigeria briefing →</span></a>
<a class="country-hub-card" href="/food-crisis-by-country/sudan/"><img class="country-hub-thumb" src="/images/articles/sudan-food-crisis.jpg" alt="Arid agricultural land and grain storage in Sudan, representing food-security pressures and regional assessment needs." loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="country-card-tag">IPC alert · 12 Oct 2026</span><h2>Sudan</h2><p>The latest cited alert on growing famine risk in parts of Greater Darfur and Greater Kordofan—without overstating its scope.</p><span class="country-card-link">Read Sudan briefing →</span></a>
