<a class="country-hub-card" href="/food-crisis-by-country/gaza/"><img class="country-hub-thumb" src="/images/articles/gaza-food-insecurity.jpg" alt="Food distribution supplies and staple-food crates in a humanitarian logistics setting, representing food-security assessment." loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="country-card-tag">IPC assessment · 23 Jul 2026</span><h2>Gaza Strip</h2><p>The IPC's documented improvement after assistance and projection of continuing high acute food insecurity through December 2026.</p><span class="country-card-link">Read Gaza briefing →</span></a>
